  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Poland port Szczecin tend</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Polen hamn Szczecin anbud</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektf&#xf6;rberedelser f&#xf6;r anl&#xe4;ggning f&#xf6;r mottagning av fartygsavfall i hamnen i Szezcin - Sweinouijscie i Polen. Hifab International kommer att genomf&#xf6;ra en studie f&#xf6;r att f&#xe5; underlag till eventuellt beslut om st&#xf6;d till investeringar i anl&#xe4;ggningen f&#xf6;r rening av oljespill, ballastvatten etc. Sidas st&#xf6;d uppg&#xe5;r till totalt SEK 66 000.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&quot;Identification Mission&quot;; Port reception facilities for ship genereated wastes in Sczezin - Swinoijscie in Poland. Hifab  International will carry out an investigation to define the  possibilities and conditions for such reception. The Swedish contribution amounts to a maximum of SEK 66 000.</narrative>
  </description>
